# Copy to .secrets-patterns.local (gitignored) and fill in your real values.
# Case-insensitive extended regexes, one per line.
#
# Strings that are not "secrets" to gitleaks but should never be committed:
#   - real IAM usernames
#   - internal hostnames
#   - colleague or customer names
#
# Example:
# my-real-admin-username
# 123456789012
